{
	"Name": "AlertQuery - Okta - Group / User - Privilege - Okta Admin Privilege Granted or Revoked (roll-up)",
	"Description": "Roll-up of every admin privilege grant and revocation, to either a user or a group. Revocations matter too: removing the role from a security team account is how an adversary stops being watched.\n\nEvent types: user.account.privilege.grant, user.account.privilege.revoke, group.privilege.grant, group.privilege.revoke\n\nReference(s):\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/reference/api/event-types/\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/api/openapi/okta-management/management/tag/SystemLog/",
